#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;toggle-group-vertical&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"disabled\">Disabled</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;toggle-group-disabled&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"custom\">Custom</h2>\n<p>A custom toggle group example.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;toggle-group-font-weight-selector&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;*:data-[slot=field]:max-w-xs&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;toggle-group-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://www.radix-ui.com/docs/primitives/components/toggle-group#api-reference\">Radix Toggle Group</a> documentation.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changelog\">Changelog</h2>\n<h3 id=\"2026-05-17-default-spacing\">2026-05-17 Default Spacing</h3>\n<p>Changed the default <code>spacing</code> from <code>0</code> to <code>2</code> so toggle groups render with space between items by default. Use <code>spacing={0}</code> for connected items.</p>"
